        ("Under 3 minutes", 530, 545, "Glory to the Mahapurana",
         "Temples are full, at Radha Vallabha, Banke Bihari, and Rangji. The duty is katha and kirtan, so love can grow. The sitting ends on the aarti. This is the last existing part."),
